{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["He mentioned at the beginning His strength, for strength is in itself, and the kindness of HaShem is the cause of my kindness. Therefore he said afterward: I will sing of Your strength (עזך), for You are my strength (עזי), like: עזי וזמרת יה (my strength and the song of YH)." "Corresponding to 'Your kindness' (חסדך) — he said 'my God of kindness' (אלהי חסדי)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 59, :register {:flags {1 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:19.388158599Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}